<title>POLAND: PETROBANK 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.27 vs    4.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.18 vs    4.05</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.76 vs    8.20</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.30 vs    8.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.85 vs   16.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   14.37 vs   17.55</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.50 vs   39.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	70.00 vs   58.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
